    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d451">

                <pb facs="0835" n="821" xml:id="pg821"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harlow, United States marshal, to Mr. Fish,
                        Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United States Marshal’s Office,
                            Southern District of New York</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1869-11-10"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">November</hi> 10, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p><seg type="margin">[121]</seg>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: From the activity which seems to pervade
                    Cuban circles, and from information gathered from the Junta by my detectives, I
                    am inclined to the opinion that measures are on foot to get off an expedition. I
                    have enjoined extra vigilance upon all the detectives, and shall use every
                    endeavor to stop any expedition which may try to sail from this port. The *only
                    source from which I can get information relative to Cuban matters is from the
                    Spanish consul, and the superintendent and two detectives connected with
                    Pinkerton’s agency, whom I continue to employ the same as my predecessor.</p>
                <p>I have only one revenue-cutter at my command—the Seward. If any emergency arises,
                    I shall do the very best that can be done with the means at my command.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>R. S. HARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Marshal.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamilton Fish</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
